# Cases at the edge of what pairwise truth-table checks can see.
SUBJECT ops, analyst, trader
RESOURCE cluster SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE reports SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE orders SUPPORTS READ, EXECUTE

ALLOW ops READ cluster WHEN a0 AND a1 AND a2 AND a3 AND a4 AND a5 AND a6 AND a7 AND a8
DENY ops READ cluster WHEN b0 AND b1 AND b2 AND b3 AND b4 AND b5 AND b6 AND b7 AND b8   # expect: W107
DENY analyst READ reports
DENY analyst WRITE reports
ALLOW analyst ACCESS reports   # expect: W103, W104  # known miss W104: only beaten by two DENYs together
ALLOW trader EXECUTE orders WHEN market_open
ALLOW trader EXECUTE orders WHEN NOT market_open
ALLOW trader EXECUTE orders WHEN mfa   # expect: W102  # known miss W102: covered only by the two rules above together
ALLOW trader READ orders
